  "bio": "Dr K (Roland) is renowned for his exceptional skill in crafting tattoos with a focus on realism and black & gray. With a dedicated passion for the art form, he not only creates stunning tattoos but also shares his extensive knowledge through online tutorials, making him a respected artist and teacher within the tattoo community. His professionalism is further exemplified by maintaining high standards of cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic experience for all his clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n◈ ʀᴇᴀʟɪꜱᴛɪᴄ / ᴘᴏʀᴛʀᴀɪᴛ / cover up\n◈ ᴠᴏʀʟᴀɢᴇɴ @dr.k_tattoo_vorlagen \n◈ ᴛᴇʟᴇꜰᴏɴ: 01773572700\n◈ ɪɴ ᴀᴇᴛᴇʀɴᴜᴍ  - ᴛᴀᴛᴛᴏᴏ ᴀᴛᴇʟɪᴇʀ Düsseldorf",
